  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fortaleza Urban Transportation Program II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Transporte Urbano Fortaleza II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program aims to contribute to the improvement of the city of Fortaleza infrastructure, in order to attend the ongoing vehicles, pedestrian and cyclists traffic demands according to the directives of the Transportation Master Plan and the Metropolitan Displacement Plan, through the reforms of the Bus Terminals and the implementation of road improvements, continuing the actions of the Fortaleza Urban Transportation Program (BR0302), in execution. The new Program is composed by following components: (i) engineering and administration, with studies and projects, program management and external auditory; (ii) Direct costs: implementation of public transportation corridors and engineering work supervisions; (iii) Strengthening of the agencies; and, (iv) expropriations.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
